      "text": "13 PROGRAM PAGES \u2014 every word is the client's own, verbatim from their live site.\n\nTHIS ROUND:\n\u00b7 Framed hero on all 13 \u2014 photo in a matted panel, lighter-black surround, centred title.\n\u00b7 Gold wash is broad and soft again, drifting a short distance inside its own area instead of shooting off as a dot. Same speed.\n\u00b7 Outlined buttons keep the white outline and gain a slow gold spark travelling the border.\n\u00b7 'Nashville MMA Training Camp' never breaks across lines.\n\nCLASS TIMES ARE SHARED \u2014 no page has a schedule typed into it; all read data/classes.json.\n\nStill coming: mobile artboards, header dropdown, then Events, Sponsors, Recovery, Coaches, FAQ and the legal pages on their own canvas."
